data: {"id": "d22f7a2c4d184542-thinking-parallel_evidence-1623", "run_id": "d22f7a2c4d184542", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Kubernetes 生命周期 (describe + yaml)**\n   - Pod 状态仍为 **Pending**，phase=Pending，容器状态 reason=`ImagePullBackOff`，restarts=0。\n   - 使用的镜像：**`registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`**，imagePullPolicy=Always。\n   - **没有配置 `imagePullSecrets`**（yaml 中为 `<absent>`），serviceAccountName=default。\n   - Pod 被 ReplicaSet `workload-65b7f54794` 创建，标签 `aiops.lab/case-id=c02`。\n\n2. **Kubernetes Events**\n   - 22m 时 kubelet 报告：`Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"`，原始错误为：\n     > `f", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789352828105, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

